                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;graph TD\n    %% External Entities (Gane &amp; Sarson: Square / Rectangular Boxes)\n    User[User / Client]:::external\n    Nominatim[Nominatim API]:::external\n    OSRM[OSRM API]:::external\n    OpenStreetMap[OpenStreetMap CARTO]:::external\n\n    %% Processes (Gane &amp; Sarson: Numbered Rounded Rectangles)\n    P1([1.0 Place Search]):::process\n    P2([2.0 Route Planning]):::process\n    P3([3.0 Saved Places Management]):::process\n    P4([4.0 Trip History Management]):::process\n    P5([5.0 Memory Pin Management]):::process\n    P6([6.0 User Preferences Management]):::process\n\n    %% Data Stores (Gane &amp; Sarson: Open-Ended / Database Shape)\n    Supabase[(Supabase Database)]:::datastore\n\n    %% Data Flows: Place Search\n    User --&gt;|Search Query| P1\n    P1 --&gt;|Requests Place Data| Nominatim\n    Nominatim --&gt;|Returns Place Data| P1\n    P1 --&gt;|Displays Search Results| User\n\n    %% Data Flows: Route Planning\n    User --&gt;|Plans Routes| P2\n    P2 --&gt;|Requests Route Data| OSRM\n    OSRM --&gt;|Returns Route Data| P2\n    P2 --&gt;|Requests Map Tiles| OpenStreetMap\n    OpenStreetMap --&gt;|Returns Map Tiles| P2\n    P2 --&gt;|Displays Routes, Fares, &amp; ETAs| User\n\n    %% Data Flows: Saved Places\n    User --&gt;|Saves / Requests Places| P3\n    P3 --&gt;|Stores &amp; Retrieves Saved Places| Supabase\n    Supabase --&gt;|Returns Saved Places Data| P3\n    P3 --&gt;|Displays Saved Places| User\n\n    %% Data Flows: Trip History\n    User --&gt;|Requests Trip History| P4\n    P4 --&gt;|Retrieves Trip Logs| Supabase\n    Supabase --&gt;|Returns Trip Logs| P4\n    P4 --&gt;|Displays Trip History| User\n\n    %% Data Flows: Memory Pins\n    User --&gt;|Uploads / Requests Pins| P5\n    P5 --&gt;|Stores &amp; Retrieves Memory Pins| Supabase\n    Supabase --&gt;|Returns Pins Data| P5\n    P5 --&gt;|Displays Memory Pins| User\n\n    %% Data Flows: User Preferences\n    User --&gt;|Updates Preferences| P6\n    P6 --&gt;|Stores &amp; Retrieves Preferences| Supabase\n    Supabase --&gt;|Returns Preferences Data| P6\n    P6 --&gt;|Applies User Settings| User\n\n    %% Styling Classes\n    classDef external fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef process fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef datastore fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="Hp06ckQG0mkrO0vJCZIz-123">
